CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/resources/CustomResource
	COMMENT CustomResource - a resource type (built-in credits/energy/ammo/hp/shield or a mod [resource_x] block). Fields: name, used (set by g() when any unit actually references the resource), isGlobal (team-wide) / isBuiltIn, hidden, valueInStats, displayName/displayNameShort, hideNameWhenIconShownInHUD / hideNameWhenIconShownInText, displayTextPrefix/displayTextPostfix, appendResource (+appendResourceWhenThisZero), displayTextAppendResourceWithGap, displayInHud, displayColor (+displayColorUseInText), displayRoundedDown, displayWhenZero, displayDigitGrouping, displayPos, iconImage (+iconImageUseInText), equivalentGlobalResource. Statics: allResources, usedResources (rebuilt by e()), lookupResources and the built-in instances CREDITS, ENERGY, AMMO, HP, SHIELD. a(String) looks a resource up by name, a(name, bool, bool) creates one, a(long, ResourceSeparator)/a(double, boolean, boolean) format amounts (credits render as "$"). Every field name comes from the matching ResourceReference field assigned in g(). [field names verified from the assignment in g()]
	FIELD a used Z
	FIELD A allResources Ljava/util/ArrayList;
	FIELD b name Ljava/lang/String;
	FIELD B usedResources Ljava/util/ArrayList;
	FIELD c displayName Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bb;
	FIELD C lookupResources Ljava/util/ArrayList;
	FIELD d displayNameShort Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bb;
	FIELD D CREDITS Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD e hideNameWhenIconShownInHUD Z
	FIELD E ENERGY Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD f hideNameWhenIconShownInText Z
	FIELD F AMMO Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD g displayTextPrefix Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bb;
	FIELD G HP Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD h displayTextPostfix Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bb;
	FIELD H SHIELD Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD i appendResource Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD j appendResourceWhenThisZero Z
	FIELD k displayTextAppendResourceWithGap Z
	FIELD l displayInHud Z
	FIELD m displayColor Ljava/lang/Integer;
	FIELD n displayColorUseInText Z
	FIELD o displayRoundedDown Z
	FIELD p displayWhenZero Z
	FIELD q displayDigitGrouping Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/b;
	FIELD r hidden Z
	FIELD s valueInStats F
	FIELD t isGlobal Z
	FIELD u isBuiltIn Z
	FIELD v equivalentGlobalResource Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/a;
	FIELD w stackHorizontal Z
	FIELD x displayPos F
	FIELD y iconImage Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/m/e;
	FIELD z iconImageUseInText Z
